msgid "Yangilikni tekshiruvga yuborasizmi? Tekshiruv tugaguncha uni tahrirlab bo‘lmaydi."
msgstr "Submit this news item for review? It cannot be edited until the review is finished."

msgid "Yangilik tekshiruvga yuborildi."
msgstr "The news item was submitted for review."

msgid "Yangilikni tekshiruvdan qaytarib olasizmi? U qoralamaga qaytadi."
msgstr "Withdraw this news item from review? It will return to drafts."

msgid "Yangilik qoralamaga qaytarildi."
msgstr "The news item was returned to drafts."

msgid "Yangilikni tuzatishga qaytarasizmi? Muallif sizning izohingizni ko‘radi."
msgstr "Return this news item for changes? The author will see your comment."

msgid "Yangilik tuzatishga qaytarildi."
msgstr "The news item was returned for changes."

msgid "Yangilikni ma’qullaysizmi? Shundan keyin vakolatli xodim uni nashr eta oladi."
msgstr "Approve this news item? An authorised employee can then publish it."

msgid "Yangilik ma’qullandi."
msgstr "The news item was approved."

msgid "Yangilikni nashr etasizmi? U ochiq saytda barcha uchun ko‘rinadi."
msgstr "Publish this news item? It will be visible to everyone on the public site."

msgid "Yangilik nashr etildi."
msgstr "News item published."

