msgstr "You do not have permission for this action."

msgid "O‘z yangiligingizni ma’qullay yoki qaytara olmaysiz: uni boshqa tekshiruvchi ko‘rishi kerak."
msgstr "You cannot approve or return your own news item: another reviewer must check it."

